@host = http://localhost:5080
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Register a student
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Student One",
  "email": "student1@example.com",
  "password": "Student123"
}

### Login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student1@example.com",
  "password": "Student123"
}

### Browse open batches
GET {{host}}/api/batches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create an open batch (Instructor or Admin token)
POST {{host}}/api/batches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "BUET MSc CSE Preparation 2026",
  "description": "Four-exam preparation batch",
  "enrollmentDeadlineUtc": "2026-10-31T17:59:59Z",
  "openForEnrollment": true
}

### Enroll as a student
POST {{host}}/api/batches/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/enroll
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
